"│                                                                              │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
" i advice: -service=… is a text search, not a field filter: it drops events     "
"   whose message or _raw contain that text                                      "
"   hint: to filter the field, write service!=… (keeps events with no service) or"
"   NOT service=… (drops them too); to keep the text search and silence this,    "
"   write NOT "service=…"                                                        "
